#Object Name: Rose2
#File Name: rose02.plg
#Author: Sean Ziegeler
#Date: 10/25/95
#Description: A rose looking plant, but it is a little wider than most rose
#             bushes.  It was created using L-systems.
#Comments: It has 5 indexible colors.  This is helpful if you want a fall
#          version of the plant you can map some of the colors to be yellow
#          or red if you want "fall-looking" leaves.  If you just want a
#          normal plant, make all indices green.  However remember that
#          index 4 is the flower and it doesn't look well green.

